    <linearGradient id=\"u4grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u4grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 4 • LESSON 14</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Zameer-e-Muttasil Mutakallim: بَيْتٌ ← بَيْتِي (Page 31–32)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">بَيْتٌ</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Zameer (ـِي)</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">بَيْتِي</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• بَيْتٌ (Ghar) se بَيْتِي (Mera ghar) banta hai.</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Qur'an Majeed mein yeh tarkeeb saikdon maqamaat par barah-e-raast samajh aati hai.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Pages 31–32):** Kisi bhi ism ke aakhir mein **`ـِي`** (Yaa-e-Mutakallim) lagane se **'Mera / Meri'** ka mafhoom paida hota hai (`بَيْتٌ ← بَيْتِي` mera ghar, `رَبٌّ ← رَبِّي` mera Rabb, `هَٰذَا رَبِّي` yeh mera Rabb hai). Agar lafz ke aakhir mein Alif ho toh Yaa par Zabar aata hai (`عَصَايَ`، `هُدَايَ`). Aur ba'az auqaat ikhtisaar ke liye Yaa gira kar sirf Zair baqi rakhi jati hai (`رَبِّ`، `يَا قَوْمِ`، `فَكَيْفَ كَانَ عِقَابِ`)."}},{"id":"sec_s4l14_r0","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Kisi bhi ism (noun) ke aakhir mein Yaa-e Mutakallim (ي) laga dein toh uska matlab hoga 'mera / meri'. Jaise: بَيْتُ (ghar) + ي = بَيْتِي (mera ghar)"}},{"id":"sec_s4l14_pair_1","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":1,"arabic":"بَيْتٌ","hinglish":"Ghar","display_mode":"paired","pair_role":"root","arabic_suffix":"","translations":{"en":"A house","ur":"گھر","hi":"घर"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">بَيْتٌ</span>","displayOrder":1},{"id":2,"arabic":"بَيْتِي","hinglish":"Mera ghar","display_mode":"paired","pair_role":"derived","arabic_root":"بَيْت","arabic_suffix":"ِي","translations":{"en":"My house","ur":"میرا گھر","hi":"मेरा घर"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">بَيْتِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ي</span>","displayOrder":2},{"id":3,"arabic":"رَبٌّ","hinglish":"Rabb","display_mode":"paired","pair_role":"root","arabic_suffix":"","translations":{"en":"Lord","ur":"رب","hi":"रब"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبٌّ</span>","displayOrder":3},{"id":4,"arabic":"رَبِّي","hinglish":"Mera Rabb","display_mode":"paired","pair_role":"derived","arabic_root":"رَبِّ","arabic_suffix":"ي","translations":{"en":"My Lord","ur":"میرا رب","hi":"मेरा रब"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبِّ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ي</span>","displayOrder":4},{"id":5,"arabic":"رَحْمَةٌ","hinglish":"Rahmat","display_mode":"paired","pair_role":"root","arabic_suffix":"","translations":{"en":"Mercy","ur":"رحمت","hi":"रहमत"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">رَحْمَةٌ</span>","displayOrder":5},{"i