10,"arabic":"هِيَ عَصَايَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">هِيَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَصَايَ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh meri laathi hai","translations":{"ur":"یہ میری لاٹھی (عصا) ہے","en":"It is my staff","hi":"यह मेरी लाठी (असा) है"},"ref":"20:18"},{"id":"s4l14_sent_s11","sentence_number":11,"arabic":"وَإِنَّ عَلَيْكَ لَعْنَتِي","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَإِنَّ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَيْكَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">لَعْنَتِي</span>","hinglish":"Aur beshak tujh par Meri la'nat hai","translations":{"ur":"اور بیشک تجھ پر میری لعنت ہے","en":"And indeed, upon you is My curse","hi":"और बेशक तुझ पर मेरी लानत है"},"ref":"38:78"},{"id":"s4l14_sent_s12","sentence_number":12,"arabic":"هَٰذَا رَبِّي هَٰذَا أَكْبَرُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">هَٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبِّي</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هَٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَكْبَرُ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh mera Rabb hai, yeh sabse bada hai","translations":{"ur":"یہ میرا رب ہے، یہ سب سے بڑا ہے","en":"This is my Lord; this is greater","hi":"यह मेरा रब है, यह सबसे बड़ा है"},"ref":"6:78"},{"id":"s4l14_sent_s13","sentence_number":13,"arabic":"أَنَا يُوسُفُ وَهَٰذَا أَخِي","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَنَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يُوسُفُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَهَٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَخِي</span>","hinglish":"Main Yusuf hoon aur yeh mera bhai hai","translations":{"ur":"میں یوسف ہوں اور یہ میرا بھائی ہے","en":"I am Joseph and this is my brother","hi":"मैं यूसुफ़ हूँ और यह मेरा भाई है"},"ref":"12:90"},{"id":"s4l14_sent_s14","sentence_number":14,"arabic":"وَأَنَا عَجُوزٌ وَهَٰذَا بَعْلِي","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَأ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">َنَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَجُوزٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَهَٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بَعْلِي</span>","hinglish":"Aur main boodhi hoon aur yeh mere shauhar hain","translations":{"ur":"حالانکہ میں بوڑھی ہوں اور یہ میرے شوہر ہیں","en":"While I am an old woman and this, my husband","hi":"हालाँकि मैं बूढ़ी हूँ और यह मेरे शौहर हैं"},"ref":"11:72"},{"id":"s4l14_sent_s15","sentence_number":15,"arabic":"أَنْتَ وَلِيِّي فِي الدُّنْيَا وَالْآخِرَةِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَنْتَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَلِيِّي</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">فِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الدُّنْيَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَالْآخِرَةِ</span>","hinglish":"Tu hi duniya aur aakhirat mein mera karsaaz hai","translations":{"ur":"تو ہی دنیا اور آخرت میں میرا کارساز ہے","en":"You are my Protector in this world and in the Hereafter","hi":"तू ही दुनिया और आख़िरत में मेरा कारसाज़ है"},"ref":"12:101"},{"id":"s4l14_sent_s16","sentence_number":16,"arabic":"وَأَنَّ هَٰذَا صِرَاطِي مُسْتَقِيمًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَأَنَّ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هَٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">صِرَاطِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مُسْتَقِيمًا</span>","hinglish":"Aur yeh ke yahi Mera seedha raasta hai","translations":{"ur":"اور یہ کہ یہی میرا سیدھا راستہ ہے","en":"And that this is My straight path","hi":"और यह कि यही मेरा सीधा रास्ता है"},"ref":"6:153"},{"id":"s4l14_sent_s17","sentence_number":17,"arabic":"وَإِنَّ عَلَيْكَ لَعْنَتِي إِلَىٰ يَوْمِ الدِّينِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَإِنَّ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَيْكَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">لَعْنَتِي</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَىٰ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يَوْمِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الدِّينِ</span>","hinglish":"Aur beshak tujh par jaza ke din tak Meri la'nat hai","translations":{"ur":"اور بیشک تجھ پر جزا کے دن تک میری لعنت ہے","en":"And indeed, upon you is My curse until the Day of Recompense","hi":"और बेशक तुझ पर जज़ा के दिन तक मेरी लानत है"},"ref":"38:78"},{"id":"s4l14_sent_s18","sentence_number":18,"arabic":"عِنْدِي خَزَائِنُ اللَّهِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">عِنْدِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">خَزَائِنُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهِ</span>","hinglish":"Mere paas Allah ke khazane hain","translations":{"ur":"میرے پاس اللہ کے خزانے ہیں","en":"With me are the treasures of Allah","hi":"मेरे पास अल्लाह के ख़ज़ाने हैं"}},{"id":"s4l14_sent_s19","sentence_number":19,"arabic":"إِنَّ مَعِيَ رَبِّي","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَعِيَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبِّي</span>","hinglish":"Beshak mere saath mera Rabb hai","translations":{"ur":"بیشک میرے ساتھ میرا رب ہے","en":"Indeed, with me is my Lord","hi":"बेशक मेरे साथ मेरा रब है"},"ref":"26:62"},{"id":"s4l14_sent_s20","sentence_number":20,"arabic":"ذَٰلِكَ بَيْنِي وَبَيْنَكَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">ذَٰلِكَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بَيْنِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَبَيْنَكَ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh mu'ahada mere aur tere darmiyan hai","translations":{"ur":"یہ بات میرے اور تیرے درمیان طے ہے","en":"That is between me and you","hi":"यह बात मेरे और तेरे दरमियान तय है"},"ref":"28:28"},{"id":"s4l14_sent_s21","sentence_number":21,"arabic":"وَأَنَا عَجُوزٌ وَهَٰذَا بَعْلِي شَيْخًا إِنَّ هَٰذَا لَشَيْءٌ عَجِيبٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَأ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">َنَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَجُوزٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَهَٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بَعْلِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">شَيْخًا</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هَٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">لَشَيْءٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَجِيبٌ</span>","hinglish":"Aur main boodhi hoon aur yeh mere shauhar bhi boodhe hain, beshak yeh badi ajeeb baat hai","translations":{"ur":"حالانکہ میں بڑھیا ہوں اور یہ میرے شوہر بوڑھے ہیں، بیشک یہ بڑی عجیب بات ہے","en":"While I am an old woman and this, my husband, is an old man; indeed, this is an amazing thing","hi":"हालाँकि मैं बुढ़िया हूँ और यह मेरे शौहर बूढ़े हैं, बेशक यह बड़ी अजीब बात है"},"full_width":true,"ref":"11:72"},{"id":"s4l14_sent_s22","sentence_number":22,"arabic":"يَا لَيْتَ بَيْنِي وَبَيْنَكَ بُعْدَ الْمَشْرِقَيْنِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">يَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">لَي</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ْتَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بَيْنِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَبَيْنَكَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بُعْدَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمَشْرِق</span><span class=\"nonroot\">َيْنِ</span>","hinglish":"Kaash mere aur tere darmiyan mashriq-o-maghrib ki doori hoti","translations":{"ur":"اے کاش! میرے اور تیرے درمیان مشرق اور مغرب کی دوری ہوتی","en":"Oh, I wish between me and you was the distance of the East and West","hi":"ऐ काश! मेरे और तेरे दरमियान मशरिक़ और मग़रिब की दूरी होती"},"full_width":true,"ref":"43:38"},{"id":"s4l14_sent_s23","sentence_number":23,"arabic":"فَكَيْفَ كَانَ عِقَابِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فَكَيْفَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">كَانَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عِقَابِ</span>","hinglish":"Toh kaisa raha Mera azaab!","translations":{"ur":"تو میری سزا کیسی رہی","en":"Then how was My punishment","hi":"तो मेरी सज़ा कैसी रही"}},{"id":"s4l14_sent_s24","sentence_number":24,"arabic":"فَكَيْفَ كَانَ نَكِيرِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فَكَيْفَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">كَانَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">نَكِيرِ</span>","hinglish":"Toh kaisi rahi Meri pakad!","translations":{"ur":"تو میری پکڑ (عذاب) کیسی رہی","en":"Then how was My reproach (punishment)","hi":"तो मेरी पकड़ (अज़ाब) कैसी रही"}},{"id":"s4l14_sent_s25","sentence_number":25,"arabic":"فَكَيْفَ كَانَ نَذِيرِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فَكَيْفَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">كَانَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">نَذِيرِ</span>","hinglish":"Toh kaisa raha Mera darana!","translations":{"ur":"تو میرا ڈرانا کیسا رہا","en":"Then how was My warning","hi":"तो मेरा डराना कैसा रहा"},"ref":"67:17"},{"id":"s4l14_sent_s26","sentence_number":26,"arabic":"وَيَا قَوْمِ هَٰذِهِ نَاقَةُ اللَّهِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَيَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">قَوْمِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هَٰذِهِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">نَاقَةُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهِ</span>","hinglish":"Aur aye meri qom! Yeh Allah ki oontni hai","translations":{"ur":"اور اے میری قوم! یہ اللہ کی اونٹنی ہے","en":"And O my people, this is the she-camel of Allah","hi":"और ऐ मेरी क़ौम! यह अल्लाह की ऊँटनी है"},"ref":"11:64"},{"id":"s4l14_sent_s27","sentence_number":27,"arabic":"يَا قَوْمِ إِنَّمَا هَٰذِهِ الْحَيَاةُ الدُّنْيَا مَتَاعٌ وَإِنَّ الْآخِرَةَ هِيَ دَارُ الْقَرَارِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">يَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">قَوْمِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّمَا</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هَٰذِهِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْحَيَاةُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الدُّنْيَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَتَاعٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَإِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْآخِرَةَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هِيَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">دَارُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْقَرَارِ</span>","hinglish":"Aye meri qom! Yeh duniya ki zindagi toh chand roz ka samaan hai aur beshak aakhirat hi hamesha rehne ka ghar hai","translations":{"ur":"اے میری قوم! یہ دنیا کی زندگی تو بس چند روزہ سامان ہے اور بیشک آخرت ہی ہمیشہ رہنے کا گھر ہے","en":"O my people, this worldly life is only temporary enjoyment, and indeed, the Hereafter — that is the home of permanent settlement","hi":"ऐ मेरी क़ौम! यह दुनिया की ज़िंदगी तो बस चंद रोज़ा सामान है और बेशक आख़िरत ही हमेशा रहने का घर है"},"full_width":true,"ref":"40:39"}]}}]}}